Z||000000||MODIFIE||04-13-2001||09:11 PM||||anyone who has modified the 2.5l and would like to share thier info pls post it here.<P>I am very intersted the 2.5l but not the sd to much $$$$$ for that. I have read that a 2.5l can be modified to 180hp with a s10 crank&block but will the block work in a 86 or any fiero. I also have read on this form that the stock crank with some machine work can go to 7000rpm but all i know is that my 86 has 6500 on the tack and i was looking for the 6th gear(ops) & remebered i had only 5 and missed 5th & hit 3rd(big ops) pop that rod out the bottem of th oil pan so know i,m going to rebuild but want the most hp out of it with out the sd parts this will be my toy not my ever day driver. THANK YOU ALL||||reg||5
